                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined the Contra Costa Board of Supervisors for a Legislative Delegation meeting this morning to share about the impacts of the Big Ugly Bill especially for Contra Costa families who rely on Medicaid to access their health care. I also addressed my continued efforts to combat the gun violence epidemic through commonsense safety measures adopted at all levels of government through my \u201cNot Here\u201d initiative. As always, I appreciate the coordination and friendship of our County Board in our collective efforts to protect and support CA-10 families.",
