                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Congressional Republicans are attempting to ram through a government funding bill that will lead to increased health costs for millions of Americans. @HouseDemocrats have an alternate plan to extend health care subsidies for working Americans, protect Medicaid, and ensure that federal dollars being held hostage by the Trump Administration are allocated properly.\nhttps://t.co/ThE4ORK0NN",
