                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Tens of thousands of Americans are already experiencing the devastating effects of the Republicans\u2019 Big Ugly Bill passed earlier this summer. Thanks to the bill\u2019s severe cuts to Medicaid and social safety net programs, families in North Carolina will go hungry and have trouble affording housing. It won\u2019t be long until communities all across the country are suffering as well.\nhttps://t.co/z51It77tWl",
