                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans know they are on the wrong side of the fight for affordable health care. It\u2019s why they are turning to blatant lies in an attempt to paint @HouseDemocrats\u2019 fight as anything other than a fight to keep health insurance premium costs down for American families. Here\u2019s the truth: undocumented immigrants are not eligible for ACA health plans nor are they eligible for the health care tax credits we are fighting to defend.\nhttps://t.co/KP4NOyAVgW",
