                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I joined my fellow @HouseDemocrats on the Capitol steps today to stand up for your health care against Republican attacks. We heard from courageous Americans whose families rely on the ACA and Medicaid and would be devastated if the Republican plans to gut both succeed. https://t.co/uEjPSmRAqQ",
