                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As Republicans remain on vacation during the government shutdown they created, @HouseDemocrats are in DC meeting with parents and physicians to hear how the Medicaid cuts and expiration of the ACA tax credits would harm families. I joined a hearing to listen first-hand to their stories and as a result my resolve to continue fighting for American families and affordable care is only strengthened.",
