                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "If Republicans allow the enhanced Affordable Care Act subsidies to expire, health care premiums will skyrocket for millions of American families. Democrats are fighting to keep premium costs from rising and ensure everyone can afford health care.\nhttps://t.co/OLufzFeeYe",
