                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "At our town hall last night, @ProtectOurCare and I discussed what is at stake for you and millions across the country n this health care crisis \u2013 insurance premiums will double for many, leaving senior citizens, small business owners, and the self-employed especially vulnerable. @KTVU",
