                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thanks to the Open House Center in Concord for welcoming me for a tour this afternoon. The disability community has long been close to my heart, and I am enraged at the ways the Trump Administration has targeted programs they rely on, including Medicaid. Today I valued the chance to hear about the day program that Open House Center offers for adults with disabilities in our community and to learn about the positive impact it has on families.",
